osa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":7,"title":"HAre and a tortoise talking on a seashore","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":8,"title":"Rabbit pushing a tortoise on a swing","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":9,"title":"Hare and a tortoise looking at butterflies","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":10,"title":"Hare and tortoise playing on a log","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":11,"title":"Hare and a tortoise eating berries","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":12,"title":"Hare and a tortoise lying among berries","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":13,"title":"Hare and a tortoise sleeping under the stars","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":14,"title":"Hare and a tortoise meet the tortoise's family","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":15,"title":"Hare and a tortoise meet the tortoise's grandmother","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":16,"title":"Injured grandma tortoise","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":17,"title":"Lady tortoise wearing a pearl bracelet","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":18,"title":"Grandma tortoise gives the hare and tortoise a flute","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":19,"title":"Hare and tortoises dance to the flute","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":20,"title":"Squirrel among butterflies","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"},{"page":21,"title":"Hare and a tortoise sleeping under the stars on a white background","illustrator":"Subi Bosa","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2019"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಟೆನೈ ಎಂಬ ಆಮೆ ನೀರಿನಲ್ಲಿ ವಾಸಿಸುತಿತ್ತು."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಟೆನೈನ ಒಳ್ಳೇ ಫ್ರೆಂಡ್ ಬಸಿ ಎಂಬ ಮೊಲ. ಅದು ಮರದ ಪೊಟರೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ವಾಸಿಸುತ್ತಿತ್ತು."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅಜ್ಜಿ ಆಮೆಯ ಚಿಪ್ಪಿಗೆ ನೋವಾಗಿದೆ."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ನಾವು ಅಜ್ಜಿಯ ಸಹಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಹೋಗಬೇಕು,” ಎಂದರು ಅಮ್ಮ."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ನನ್ನ ಜೊತೆ ಇರುವಂತೆ ಬಾ,” ಎಂದು ಕರೆಯಿತು ಬಸಿ."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಟೆನೈ ಬಸಿಯ ಜೊತೆ ಮರದ ಪೊಟರೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಉಳಿದುಕೊಂಡಿತು."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅವೆರಡೂ ದಿನ ಆಟ ಆಡುತ್ತಿದ್ದವು."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಒಟ್ಟಿಗೆ ಮಲಗುತ್ತಿದ್ದವು."]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಒಂದು ದಿನ ಅಪ್ಪ-ಅಮ್ಮ, ಅಜ್ಜಿಯನ್ನು ಕರೆದುಕೊಂಡು ಬಂದರು."]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["“ಅಜ್ಜಿsss, ಹೇಗಿದೀಯಾ?” ಟೆನೈ ವಿಚಾರಿಸಿತು."]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p15.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಈಗ ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ಆರಾಮಾಗಿದೆ,” ಅಜ್ಜಿ ನಗುತ್ತ ಉತ್ತರಿಸಿದರು."]},{"n":16,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p16.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಹೇಗೋ, ಚಿಪ್ಪು ಸರಿಯಾಗಿ ಅಜ್ಜಿಯ ನೋವು ಕಡಿಮೆಯಾಯಿತು,” ಎಂದರು ಅಮ್ಮ."]},{"n":17,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p17.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಅಜ್ಜಿ ತನ್ನ ಮೆಚ್ಚಿನ ಕೊಳಲನ್ನು, ಟೆನೈಗೆ ಕೊಟ್ಟರು."]},{"n":18,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p18.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಟೆನೈ ಕೊಳಲು ಊದುತ್ತಿದ್ದಂತೆ, ಎಲ್ಲರೂ ಕುಣಿದರು."]},{"n":19,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p19.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":20,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p20.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]}],"wordCount":79}